    <ns0:title>3.4.1</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;DSPy 3.4.1&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DSPy 3.4.1 makes GEPA's structured &lt;code&gt;InstructionProposer&lt;/code&gt; the default instruction proposer and lets &lt;code&gt;dspy.RLM&lt;/code&gt; build DSPy sub-agents from inside its REPL. It also adds Python 3.15 support, fixes a 3.4.0 import crash, and includes streaming, adapter, and interpreter fixes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative over</ns0:content>
