  <ns0:entry>
    <ns0:id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/587050620/3.3.1</ns0:id>
    <ns0:updated>2026-08-21T23:07:09Z</ns0:updated>
    <ns0:link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/stanfordnlp/dspy/releases/tag/3.3.1" />
    <ns0:title>3.3.1</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;DSPy 3.3.1&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DSPy 3.3.1 contains many interpreter fixes and improvements. It makes &lt;code&gt;PythonInterpreter&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;
easier to install, substantially strengthens sandbox isolation and request&lt;br&gt;
handling, and adds end-to-end visibility into interpreter execution. The release&lt;br&gt;
also improves optimizer throughput, adapter correctness, and MCP compatibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;</ns0:content>
