    <ns0:title>3.3.0</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;DSPy 3.3.0&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DSPy 3.3.0 is a feature release with a new experimental way to optimize programs as code, a native-tool-aware ReAct implementation, and the next stage of DSPy's move toward a typed, provider-neutral language-model system.&lt;/p&gt;
