    <ns0:title>3.3.0b1</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;DSPy 3.3.0b1 Release Notes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DSPy 3.3.0b1 is a beta release including a new ReActV2 module, a new BaseLM System, updating to GEPA 0.1.1, and fewer dependencies framework wide.&lt;/p&gt;
